{
  "notes": {
    "frontend": "Next.js and React with TypeScript for almost everything, styled with Tailwind. Server data through TanStack Query; client state in Zustand, or Redux on larger existing apps. Astro for content-heavy sites.",
    "backend": "Postgres on Neon or Supabase, through Prisma or Drizzle, with Zod at every boundary. MongoDB where a project already uses it. Node, Express or Bun for APIs, Socket.io for realtime, GraphQL when an API speaks it. Better Auth, Clerk, Auth0 or my own JWT/OAuth for sign-in, Paystack for payments and Resend for email.",
    "tools": "n8n and Make for automations: webhooks, CRMs, email, AI steps. Vitest and Playwright for tests, Docker Compose for local services, Git and GitHub for everything, Vercel for deploys.",
    "design": "Figma to read designers’ files closely, and to sketch my own screens before I build them."
  },
